    "/v1/gates/test": {
      "post": {
        "tags": ["Gates"],
        "summary": "Test a gate configuration with a sample request",
        "description": "**Use when:** caller wants to send a sample request through a gate (production or draft) to verify routing, parameter handling, and output without leaving an audit trail\n\nRuns a quick test against a gate's primary model (and optionally every fallback model) with the supplied messages, returning per-model success/latency/content/error. Accepts either a stored `gateId` (looks up the saved config), an inline `gate` config override, or both (the override merges over the saved config). Set `quickTest: true` to skip the fallback walk and only test the primary.",
        "security": [
          {
            "bearerAuth": []
          }
        ],
        "x-use-when": "caller wants to send a sample request through a gate (production or draft) to verify routing, parameter handling, and output without leaving an audit trail",
